"locurilor."

#: includes/seating/class-seating-admin.php:1074 js/seating_admin.js:36
msgid "Visual Layout (Seat Map)"
msgstr "Aspect vizual (Hartă locuri)"

#: includes/seating/class-seating-admin.php:1075 js/seating_admin.js:37
